<title>USA: US Stockpile to hold next lead sale on Jan 9.</title>
<headline>US Stockpile to hold next lead sale on Jan 9.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center on Friday said it had rescheduled its next bid opening for surplus lead to Thursday, January 9, at 1500 EST (2000 GMT).</p>
<p>The bid opening, originally scheduled for January 2, was postponed one week due to the New Year's Day holiday.</p>
<p>The DNSC usually holds its lead bids on the first Thursday of every month.</p>
</text>
